{
 "html": "<section id=\"direction\" data-bg=\"beam\" aria-labelledby=\"direction-title\" style=\"background: var(--surface-card); border-block: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-block: var(--section-y);\">\n    <div class=\"cory-container\" style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-10);\">\n      <div data-reveal=\"\" data-stack=\"\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 3fr) minmax(0px, 2fr); gap: var(--space-5) var(--space-12); align-items: end;\">\n        <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-3); min-inline-size: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"cory-overline\" style=\"margin: 0px;\">Aspiration</p>\n          <h2 id=\"direction-title\" style=\"margin: 0px; max-inline-size: 24ch; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold); font-size: var(--text-fluid-title); line-height: var(--leading-snug); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter); color: var(--text-strong); text-wrap: balance;\">To be the one who can build an <span style=\"background: var(--gradient-text); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;\">app</span>, a <span style=\"background: var(--gradient-text); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;\">platform</span> and a <span style=\"background: var(--gradient-text); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;\">business</span>.</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0px; max-inline-size: var(--measure-lead); font-size: var(--text-body-lg); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--text-body); text-wrap: pretty;\">For myself and for the people I work with. Everything I know, design, systems, accessibility, AI, leading teams, goes into these three.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-bento-cq=\"\">\n        <ol data-reveal-group=\"\" class=\"cory-bento\" role=\"list\">\n          <li class=\"tall cory-on-ink\" data-cq=\"\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-5); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--gradient-ink); border: 1px solid var(--on-ink-border); color: var(--on-ink-body); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); min-inline-size: 0px;\">\n            <div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; inline-size: 90%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; inset-inline-end: -35%; inset-block-start: -45%; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--glow-cyan-strong); z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;\"></div>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-3);\">\n              <p class=\"cory-overline\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--on-ink-link);\">Why all three</p>\n              <h3 style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold); font-size: var(--text-h3); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight); color: var(--on-ink-strong); text-wrap: balance;\">One skill set, three kinds of thing worth building</h3>\n              <p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--on-ink-body); text-wrap: pretty;\">An app is something a person uses. A platform is something other people build on. A business is what keeps both alive. I want to be able to do all three, with AI or without it.</p>\n            </div>\n            <dl style=\"margin: 0px; margin-block-start: auto; display: grid; gap: var(--space-3);\">\n              <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-1); padding-block-start: var(--space-3); border-block-start: 1px solid var(--on-ink-border);\"><dt style=\"font-size: var(--text-caption); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); color: var(--on-ink-muted);\">For others</dt><dd style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--on-ink-strong);\">Products, systems and growth for employers and clients</dd></div>\n              <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-1); padding-block-start: var(--space-3); border-block-start: 1px solid var(--on-ink-border);\"><dt style=\"font-size: var(--text-caption); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); color: var(--on-ink-muted);\">For myself</dt><dd style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--on-ink-strong);\">My own apps and platforms today, my own business in time</dd></div>\n            </dl>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"tall\" data-cq=\"\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--surface-page); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); min-inline-size: 0px;\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"inline-size: 44px; block-size: 44px; flex-shrink: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--gradient-ink); color: var(--on-ink-strong);\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M10 4v4M2 8h20M6 4v4\"></path></svg></span>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-2);\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold); font-size: var(--text-fluid-h2); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter); background: var(--gradient-text); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; inline-size: fit-content; max-inline-size: 100%;\">App</h3>\n              <p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-body-md); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--text-body); text-wrap: pretty;\">Apps people enjoy using: clear states, honest copy, and nothing that makes a person guess.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-2);\">\n              <p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); color: var(--text-subtle);\">What I bring</p>\n              <ul role=\"list\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2);\"><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Product design</span></div></li><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">AI states and copy</span></div></li><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Accessibility</span></div></li><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Prototyping</span></div></li></ul>\n            </div>\n            <a data-link=\"\" href=\"Work.dc.html\" style=\"margin-block-start: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-1); inline-size: fit-content; min-block-size: var(--tap-target); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-link);\"><span>See the work</span><svg data-dir-icon=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"tall\" data-cq=\"\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--surface-page); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); min-inline-size: 0px;\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"inline-size: 44px; block-size: 44px; flex-shrink: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--gradient-ink); color: var(--on-ink-strong);\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></span>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-2);\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold); font-size: var(--text-fluid-h2); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter); background: var(--gradient-text); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; inline-size: fit-content; max-inline-size: 100%;\">Platform</h3>\n              <p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-body-md); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--text-body); text-wrap: pretty;\">Platforms others build on: design systems, tokens and spec files that engineers and AI agents both consume.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-2);\">\n              <p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); color: var(--text-subtle);\">What I bring</p>\n              <ul role=\"list\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2);\"><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Design systems</span></div></li><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Tokens and specs</span></div></li><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Documentation</span></div></li><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Agent-ready UI</span></div></li></ul>\n            </div>\n            <a data-link=\"\" href=\"Case Study.dc.html?case=colaberry-design-system\" style=\"margin-block-start: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-1); inline-size: fit-content; min-block-size: var(--tap-target); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-link);\"><span>Read the design system case</span><svg data-dir-icon=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"tall\" data-cq=\"\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--surface-page); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); min-inline-size: 0px;\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"inline-size: 44px; block-size: 44px; flex-shrink: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--gradient-ink); color: var(--on-ink-strong);\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M22 13a18.15 18.15 0 0 1-20 0\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-2);\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold); font-size: var(--text-fluid-h2); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter); background: var(--gradient-text); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; inline-size: fit-content; max-inline-size: 100%;\">Business</h3>\n              <p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-body-md); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--text-body); text-wrap: pretty;\">Businesses that last, built the same way: find the gap, pick the metric, ship the system that moves it.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-2);\">\n              <p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); color: var(--text-subtle);\">What I bring</p>\n              <ul role=\"list\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2);\"><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Product ownership</span></div></li><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Growth design</span></div></li><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Content systems</span></div></li><li><div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: var(--text-caption); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); white-space: nowrap;\" data-badge=\"\">Team leadership</span></div></li></ul>\n            </div>\n            <a data-link=\"\" href=\"Services.dc.html\" style=\"margin-block-start: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-1); inline-size: fit-content; min-block-size: var(--tap-target); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-link);\"><span>See services</span><svg data-dir-icon=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
